+ *   | Series et diagrammes                        |  description and
+ *   | ( Ouvrir )                                  |  the Open button
+ *   | A decouvrir                                 |
+ *   | [card] [card] [card] [card]                 |  more apps
+ *   +---------------------------------------------+
+ *
+ * The background is the "key art" of the selected app: a dark gradient lit
+ * by a glow of the app's colour, two ribbons of light and sparkles drifting
+ * up. Animations: boot flare, "who is playing?" profile screen, tiles sliding
+ * in, smooth row, hero sliding in, key art floating with orbiting lights,
